"stem": "An irritable 8-year-old child has a history of nearly daily temper outbursts both at home and at school over the past 2 years. These outbursts are age-inappropriate and severe. Between outbursts, what characteristic mood is required to qualify this child for a diagnosis of disruptive mood dysregulation disorder?", 
